{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120419","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120419/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120419/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120419/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120419","id":4696662466,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7oKcDM","number":120419,"title":"Allow empty documentation comments to act as line breaks","user":{"login":"AtomicAntt","id":89709922,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5NzA5OTIy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89709922?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtomicAntt","html_url":"https://github.com/AtomicAntt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtomicAntt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtomicAntt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtomicAntt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtomicAntt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtomicAntt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtomicAntt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtomicAntt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtomicAntt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtomicAntt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-06-18T23:24:26Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T08:36:19Z","closed_at":"2026-10-04T08:36:04Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120419","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120419","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120419.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120419.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\nCloses https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/13157\r\n\r\nBlank lines in documentation comments will be automatically interpreted as line breaks. Example:\r\n```gdscript\r\n## Example description for this variable.\r\n##\r\n## This variable can be true or false.\r\n@export var my_variable: bool = true\r\n```\r\n<img width=\"606\" height=\"111\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ccc3f6e2-5b11-4845-b32b-8a6a7421c5cb\" />\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\nTo try to maintain compatibility with previously written documentation comments, users who use `[br][br]` to make these kind of line breaks won't result in blank documentation comments creating additional line breaks. For example, users who write this won't have extra line breaks as a result:\r\n```gdscript\r\n## Example description for this variable. [br][br]\r\n##\r\n## This variable can be true or false.\r\n@export var my_variable: bool = true\r\n```\r\n(The resulting documentation generated will be the same)\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120419/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":1,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120419/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}